SUMMARY:For Garden's Sake: O'Kelly Chapel's Ribbon Cutting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261016T070000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261016T100000
UID:f6513d3ca1777e33e8e52a21f77917b7@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:History\, restoration\, and a new chapter are coming together 
 for a very special celebration in Durham! Join the Greater Durham Chamber 
 of Commerce for the Ribbon Cutting Celebration of the beautifully renovate
 d O’Kelly Chapel at For Garden’s Sake. October 16 carries special hist
 orical significance\, marking 200 years since the death of James O’Kelly
 \, the influential minister and religious leader for whom O’Kelly Chapel
  is named. This celebration will honor that history while officially welco
 ming a new chapter for this treasured space. Nestled on the grounds of For
  Garden’s Sake\, O’Kelly Chapel is a historic early 1900s chapel fille
 d with character and charm. For Garden’s Sake has thoughtfully renovated
  and restored the chapel\, helping preserve an important piece of local hi
 story while transforming it into a beautiful event venue available for wed
 dings\, ceremonies\, celebrations\, private gatherings\, and other special
  occasions. For Garden’s Sake has served the Durham and Triangle communi
 ty
LOCATION:Durham\, NC
URL:https://members.durhamchamber.org/events/details/for-garden-s-sake-o-k
 elly-chapel-s-ribbon-cutting
X-SOURCE:Durham Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
